    {
      "subId": "7601816",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760181601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760181601": {
            "id": "760181601",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*sob*... Valberry Jelly... It went back up to the sky to be with its friends...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181603"
            ]
          },
          "760181603": {
            "id": "760181603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon heard that when a Tassel Jelly reaches the end of its life, it can start over as a little jellyfish, so long as it makes it back to the sky. Paimon wonders if that's really true...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181605",
              "760181607"
            ]
          },
          "760181605": {
            "id": "760181605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, yeah... If they stayed trapped inside those barriers, they wouldn't be able to fly back to the sky.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181609"
            ]
          },
          "760181609": {
            "id": "760181609",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So those two we saved earlier must be with Valberry Jelly right now, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181602"
            ]
          },
          "760181602": {
            "id": "760181602",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "<UNKNOWN>",
            "text": "We cleared out all those nasty machines, and the environment's back to normal, so there's no need to worry anymore!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181610"
            ]
          },
          "760181610": {
            "id": "760181610",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hmm... {NICKNAME}, do you think it'll remember us when it grows up again?"
          },
          "760181607": {
            "id": "760181607",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon wants to believe it, too! After all, Valberry Jelly really did have mysterious powers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181608"
            ]
          },
          "760181608": {
            "id": "760181608",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So those two we saved earlier must be with Valberry Jelly right now, right?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7601809",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760180901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760180901": {
            "id": "760180901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What are we supposed to do now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180902"
            ]
          },
          "760180902": {
            "id": "760180902",
            "speakerId": 21923,
            "speakerName": "\"Valberry Jelly\"",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180903"
            ]
          },
          "760180903": {
            "id": "760180903",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "The Tassel Jelly — which has been quietly floating up to this point — suddenly presses itself against the \"Access Confirmation Terminal.\" A flash of light follows, and the barrier disappears.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180904"
            ]
          },
          "760180904": {
            "id": "760180904",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "As the light fades, the little jellyfish returns to its gentle floating, though its movements suggest it is much weaker than before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180905"
            ]
          },
          "760180905": {
            "id": "760180905",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa! So it can disable these barriers by itself? That would've been nice to know earlier!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180919"
            ]
          },
          "760180919": {
            "id": "760180919",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't you agree, Valberry Jelly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180921"
            ]
          },
          "760180921": {
            "id": "760180921",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why isn't it responding? We were totally getting along...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180920"
            ]
          },
          "760180920": {
            "id": "760180920",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Valberry Jelly gives no response to Paimon's question. Its tentacles droop weakly — it looks completely drained...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180907"
            ]
          },
          "760180907": {
            "id": "760180907",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It looks a lot weaker than before...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180910"
            ]
          },
          "760180910": {
            "id": "760180910",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Did it use up all its strength just now? No, no, that can't be it! Valberry Jelly was already running low on energy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180911"
            ]
          },
          "760180911": {
            "id": "760180911",
            "speakerId": 21923,
            "speakerName": "\"Valberry Jelly\"",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180912"
            ]
          },
          "760180912": {
            "id": "760180912",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "In the end... W—We still couldn't make it in time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180913"
            ]
          },
          "760180913": {
            "id": "760180913",
            "speakerId": 21923,
            "speakerName": "\"Valberry Jelly\"",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180914"
            ]
          },
          "760180914": {
            "id": "760180914",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are you angry? Or sad? Or not feeling well? Hmm, it doesn't seem like any of those... Ugh, this is so frustrating! How are we supposed to know what it's trying to say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180915"
            ]
          },
          "760180915": {
            "id": "760180915",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This seems like a gesture it would only make for one of its own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180916"
            ]
          },
          "760180916": {
            "id": "760180916",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Does that mean... even though we couldn't save its friends, it still wants to thank us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180917"
            ]
          },
          "760180917": {
            "id": "760180917",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It seems like jellyfish have more heart than the Fatui ever will. Those guys build all those horrible machines, and they don't care about life one bit!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180918"
            ]
          },
          "760180918": {
            "id": "760180918",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So really, who's the one with no brain?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180906"
            ]
          },
          "760180906": {
            "id": "760180906",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, just thinking about those dumb Fatui getting all flustered when they realize their hidden keys were messed with... it's kinda funny.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180908"
            ]
          },
          "760180908": {
            "id": "760180908",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... It really does look paler now, and a bit weaker than before, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760180909"
            ]
          },
          "760180909": {
            "id": "760180909",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But... It looks way weaker than before."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7601812",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760181201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760181201": {
            "id": "760181201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh!? What's going on? That was the switch for this barrier? Then that means, at least the other side...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181202"
            ]
          },
          "760181202": {
            "id": "760181202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh! Valberry Jelly dropped to the floor again... It's that nasty machine's fault!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181203"
            ]
          },
          "760181203": {
            "id": "760181203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wh—What do we do now?! We're trapped too. How are we supposed to help the jellies like this...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181206"
            ]
          },
          "760181206": {
            "id": "760181206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Being stuck with {NICKNAME} isn't so scary. But Paimon's worried about Valberry Jelly and the others...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181207"
            ]
          },
          "760181207": {
            "id": "760181207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Look! There's some records here. They might contain a clue!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181208"
            ]
          },
          "760181208": {
            "id": "760181208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon was hoping for something to help shut down the barrier, not just a bunch of complaints...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181209"
            ]
          },
          "760181209": {
            "id": "760181209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But at least we're not like the Fatuus who wrote this — stuck in here alone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181210"
            ]
          },
          "760181210": {
            "id": "760181210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Umm, since Valberry Jelly and Paimon can both fly, th—then maybe Paimon might be able to do the same thing Valberry Jelly did, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181211"
            ]
          },
          "760181211": {
            "id": "760181211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760181212"
            ]
          },
          "760181212": {
            "id": "760181212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Uhm... Nothing happened. Paimon guesses she doesn't have the right kind of power. At the very least, Paimon was hoping you could escape, {NICKNAME}..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}